{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"toolshed_web_search","tool":"call_web_search","arguments":{"fast_mode":false,"web_search_instructions":"site:prodigi.com/print-api/docs API product SKU clothing t-shirt GLOBAL-TEE sandbox v4.0 product catalog"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Research Report: Prodigi API Product SKU Clothing T-Shirt GLOBAL-TEE Sandbox v4.0 Product Catalog\n\n## Executive Summary\n\nProdigi's Print API v4.0 offers a comprehensive product catalog featuring various t-shirt options under the \"GLOBAL-TEE\" SKU prefix. The API provides detailed product information, including attributes, variants, and fulfillment details, accessible through the sandbox environment for testing purposes.\n\n## Key Findings\n\n- **Finding 1:** Prodigi's API v4.0 includes a \"Product Details\" endpoint that returns comprehensive data for a given SKU, such as available destinations, attributes, required assets, and dimensions. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Finding 2:** The \"GLOBAL-TEE\" SKU prefix encompasses a range of t-shirts, including the Bella+Canvas 3005 V-neck t-shirt, which is fulfilled from multiple locations (UK, EU, US, CA, AU) and ships worldwide. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/mens-clothing/t-shirts/v-neck/bella-canvas-3005/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Finding 3:** The API's sandbox environment allows developers to test order placements without actual fulfillment or charges, facilitating integration and testing processes. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/blog/your-first-print-api-order/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Finding 4:** Prodigi offers a diverse selection of t-shirts under the \"GLOBAL-TEE\" SKU, including options like the Gildan 64000L and Bella+Canvas 8413, catering to various styles and preferences. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/womens-clothing/t-shirts/classic/gildan-64000l/?utm_source=openai))\n\n---\n\n## Detailed Source Analysis\n\n### Source 1: Prodigi API Documentation\n\n- **URL:** ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Domain:** prodigi.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Commercial\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official API documentation from Prodigi)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThe Prodigi API Documentation provides detailed information on the \"Product Details\" endpoint, which returns all available data for a specific SKU. This includes product dimensions, attributes, print areas, and variants. The documentation also outlines the structure of the Product Details object and provides example responses for clarity.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Example SKU: \"GLOBAL-CAN-10X10\"\n\n- Attributes include options like \"wrap\" with values such as \"Black,\" \"ImageWrap,\" \"MirrorWrap,\" and \"White.\"\n\n- Print areas are specified with required dimensions and resolutions.\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"The Product Details endpoint returns all available data for a SKU, such as available destinations, attributes, and its required assets and dimensions.\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 2: Print on Demand V-neck T-Shirt Bella+Canvas 3005\n\n- **URL:** ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/mens-clothing/t-shirts/v-neck/bella-canvas-3005/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Domain:** prodigi.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Commercial\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official product listing from Prodigi)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThis product page details the Bella+Canvas 3005 V-neck t-shirt, highlighting its tailored fit, V-neck design, and short sleeves. Made from 100% combed and ring-spun cotton, it offers a super-soft feel. The t-shirt is fulfilled from multiple locations, including the UK, EU, US, CA, and AU, and ships worldwide. Production time ranges from 72 to 120 hours.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Available sizes: S, M, L, XL, 2XL\n\n- Printing method: Direct to garment\n\n- Wholesale cost: From £9.00\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"Each piece is custom printed using direct-to-garment technology, ensuring super-sharp detail and vibrant, long-lasting colour, before being packaged and shipped directly to your customer.\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 3: How to Place your First Order with the Prodigi Print API\n\n- **URL:** ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/blog/your-first-print-api-order/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Domain:** prodigi.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** March 19, 2021\n\n- **Source Type:** Blog Post\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official blog post from Prodigi)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThis blog post guides users through placing their first order using the Prodigi Print API. It emphasizes the importance of using the sandbox environment for testing, selecting products via SKUs, and understanding image requirements. The post provides a step-by-step example of creating an order, including the necessary API requests and data formats.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Example SKU used: \"GLOBAL-FAP-16x24\"\n\n- Image resolution recommendation: 300 pixels per inch\n\n- Image formats accepted: JPG and PNG\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"This code example uses our sandbox environment, so the item will not be printed or shipped, and you will not be charged.\"\n\n---\n\n## Cross-Reference Analysis\n\n**Consensus Across Sources:**\n\n- The Prodigi API v4.0 provides detailed product information through the \"Product Details\" endpoint, including attributes, variants, and fulfillment details. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- The sandbox environment is recommended for testing API integrations without incurring charges or initiating actual fulfillment. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/blog/your-first-print-api-order/?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Conflicting Information:**\n\n- No significant conflicting information was identified across the sources.\n\n**Information Gaps:**\n\n- Specific details regarding the complete list of t-shirt products under the \"GLOBAL-TEE\" SKU prefix are not fully detailed in the provided sources.\n\n- Pricing information for certain products is not specified and may require direct inquiry or account creation.\n\n---\n\n## Research Metadata\n\n- **Search Completed:** 2026-08-24T05:50:04Z\n\n- **Sources Analyzed:** 3 sources\n\n- **Total Content Reviewed:** Approximately 1,200 words\n\n- **Search Confidence:** High (Based on the credibility and relevance of the sources) "}],"_meta":{"openai/widgetSessionId":"7827ca5a-af1c-4b38-96a4-26450cbe6eb9"},"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
